**To add tier metadata**, extend HostModels (lines 26–36) with optional fields like:
```rust
pub tier: Option<&'static str>,  // "fast", "balanced", "thorough"
pub cost_hint: Option<&'static str>,  // "cheap", "moderate", "expensive"
pub capabilities: &'static [&'static str],  // ["code", "reasoning", "vision", ...]
