**HostCliHandDispatcher creation** (lines 169–183):
```rust
let dispatcher = HostCliHandDispatcher::new(
    substrate.clone(),
    hosts.clone(),
    host_name_for_kind(hand_kind).unwrap_or("codex"),
    hand_kind,
    model,  // RAW model id from resolve_executor()
